OL,3,GNEWSAKevin Sinfield's MND runs inspire
OL,4,Acycle challenge
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who ran alongside Sir Kevin
OL,7,FSinfield before he started his final
OL,8,Fchallenge to raise awareness of motor
OL,9,Fneurone disease (MND) said he feels
OL,10,F"confident but nervous" about his own
OL,11,Ffundraising challenge.
OL,13,FGlen Hartley, from Hull, will cycle
OL,14,Fmore than 170 miles (113km) between
OL,15,FFriday and Sunday with his friend, Jon
OL,16,FFish.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,385,380,200,160,0,100
