OL,3,GNEWSAKevin Sinfield's MND runs inspire
OL,4,Acycle challenge
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe three-day ride will raise money for
OL,7,FAndy's Man Club and the Motor Neurone
OL,8,FDisease Association, a cause which he
OL,9,Fsaid was "very personal" to him due to
OL,10,Fhis father Paul being diagnosed with a
OL,11,Fform of MND.
OL,13,FGlen said: "When [Sinfield] finishes on
OL,14,FSaturday, I'll be thinking of him while
OL,15,FI'm tackling the hills between
OL,16,FSheffield and Leeds for my challenge."
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
